{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24034","headline":"立秋夕有怀梦得 · 白居易","name":"立秋夕有怀梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露簟荻竹清，风扇蒲葵轻。\n一与故人别，再见新蝉鸣。\n是夕凉飙起，闲境入幽情。\n回灯见栖鹤，隔竹闻吹笙。\n夜茶一两杓，秋吟三数声。\n所思渺千里，云外长洲城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}